icial Communist Party line. New studies show a surprising twist: American artificial-intelligence models are unwittingly doing the same\u2014and researchers say AI companies haven\u2019t done much to fix it. The unexpected censorship comes in part from how AI models are trained. They act as a giant blender, gobbling up mountains of data across the web, including state-controlled media. That leaves the resulting smoothie with a taste of authoritarian propaganda.", "large_image": "FsBxuNfP6fBH8qXS.png", "title": "Chinese Censorship Is Leaking Into Answers From American AI"}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}], "status": true}